    "updated_at": "2018-09-06T06:51:01Z",
    "body": "This code appears to have come from https://trac.webkit.org/r19872. We have the same code in WebKit. What's crazy is that `event.composedPath()` seems to indicate Blink, Gecko, and WebKit all seem to be stopping the propagation instead of shrinking the event path in the first place.",
